WEBVTT

00:29:58.918 --> 00:30:02.076
She started selling
instructional videos on VHS tapes.

00:30:02.100 --> 00:30:06.945
Then, as technology changed,
she switched to CDs, then DVDs.

00:30:06.969 --> 00:30:09.756
Then she launched the website Lynda.com.

00:30:09.780 --> 00:30:10.964
In the late '90s,

00:30:10.988 --> 00:30:12.907
she and her business partner and husband

00:30:12.931 --> 00:30:15.098
tried launching memberships on Lynda.com.

00:30:15.122 --> 00:30:16.987
They weren't exactly an instant hit.

00:30:17.011 --> 00:30:19.942
LW: In the beginning
it was just an abject failure.

00:30:19.966 --> 00:30:22.980
It was cannibalizing
some of our other work.

00:30:23.004 --> 00:30:24.494
AG: But they didn't give up.

00:30:24.518 --> 00:30:26.647
Not every experiment succeeds,

00:30:26.671 --> 00:30:28.980
and they don't all succeed right away.

00:30:29.004 --> 00:30:30.885
Memberships weren't growing like crazy,